OL,3,GNEWSACovid impact drove campaign for
OL,4,Anew skatepark
OL,5,
OL,6,FA skatepark is opening in Surrey after
OL,7,Fa man set out to combat the effects of
OL,8,Fthe Covid pandemic on young people.
OL,10,FMartin Elbourne, 70, a retired
OL,11,Fmarketing consultant, helped drive
OL,12,Fplans for the new facility at Cobham,
OL,13,Fwhich is set to officially open on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe skatepark was created following
OL,17,Fconsultation with more than 200 local
OL,18,Fyoung people, who helped influence its
OL,19,Fdesign.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
