OL,3,GNEWSACovid impact drove campaign for
OL,4,Anew skatepark
OL,5,
OL,6,FElbourne said the #850,000 scheme was
OL,7,Fintended to support younger people in
OL,8,Fthe community, adding: "I just wanted
OL,9,Fto do something for the children."
